      <Comment source="PMN, zhang, THE-ARABIDOPSIS-INFORMATION-RESOURCE, dreher">This conjugate is likely to be an inactive form of IBA in the roots because it does not cause the root-specific physiological responses observed for IBA when it is applied to exogenously to Arabidopsis plants. However, it may have activity in aerial tissues or in specific cell types |CITS: [20798329]|.</Comment>
